  "source_explanation": [
    "Both GetPlayerColors and GuestPowerupPalette have genuine BillVariant1-specific Lance rows1C/36/0F at every tier; neither chooses a different Lance row by Easy/Hard.",
    "The pinned Bill003 Lance sheet has red/orange248/56/0 pants. Its packer assigns those pixels to spritepalette2/index1; QueueGuestWeaponPalette sets3F19=16,3F1A=30,3F1B=27, independently of Easy/Hard. Hair/skin/outline use palette0.",
    "OrdinaryLowPressurePose explicitly rejects BillVariant1, so the Bill WALK2 compact layout cannot replace Lance art. RosterPose selects genuine RgLANCE records for both modes/allthree tiers.",
    "Bill is intentionally different: palette0 pants use12 at tier0,11 at tier1,16 at tier2. Its blue0/1 and red2 are defined both in normal and original powerup-palette tables."
  ],
